              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Musani d'iiga qori keesa jiru kaani fuud'e biyya irati fifit'e waan jed'e, Kunini d'iiga wold'aqisaa isani AABBO Waaqaani woliini tolfattani jabeesu, gaafa inni aada tana ch'ufa isanii kenne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Musa, Haruni, Nadabu, Abihu ammalle jaaroleeni torbatama ta Israeli gaara olkorani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "artiti Waaqa Israeli argani. Miila isaa jalati waan ballo aka d'akha bule ch'uluqa jira, bule aka garaa Waaqaa, argani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Waaqi worra gugurda Israeli kana woma intolchine; worri Waaqa arge woliini wo nyaatani d'ugani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gaafa Musani gaara Sinai gubbaa jiru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba AABBO Waaqi waan Musani jed'e, Gaara gubbati nati kooti, ammo ato atini arma jirtu, anini d'akha lama hahafalicha, ka seera anini biyyaa jed'e baase irati t'aafe siti kenna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musafi nami isa qarqaaru, ka Yoshua jed'ani, kurfefatani, duuba Musani, gaara qulqullo olkore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musani waan jaaroleeni jed'e, Isani armumati nu eega, haga nu gaddachaanuti. Harunifi Huriini isani woliini jirani; duuba nami wold'abu ch'ufti ha worrati yau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Musani gaara olkore jennaani dumansi gaara suni duuche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifsaani bibiliqu ka aka AABBO Waaqi achi jiru garsiisu d'ufe gaara Sinai ira tae. Worra Israeliti ifsaani sunini aka ibida fiit'e gaara gubuu jiru fakaata. Duuba dumansi gaara suni guyya jaa duuche, guyya torbeeso AABBO Waaqi Musa dumansa keesaa yaame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16+EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16",
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 9.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musani dumansa keesa gaara olkore guyya afurtamatiifi halkani afurtama achi tae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
